[65.540095, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe wheel built successfully. Next I’ll assemble a PEP 503-style package index, host it with Python’s HTTP server, and confirm the index is reachable before \r\ntesting pip.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nmkdir -p /app/pypi/simple/vectorops /app/pypi/packages\r\ncp /app/dist/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl /app/pypi/packages/\r\ncat > /app/pypi/simple/vectorops/index.html <<'EOF'\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n  <head>\r\n    <meta name=\"pypi:repository-version\" content=\"1.0\">\r\n    <title>Links for vectorops</title>\r\n  </head>\r\n  <body>\r\n    <h1>Links for vectorops</h1>\r\n    <a href=\"/packages/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl#sha256=PLACEHOLDER\">vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl</a>\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\nEOF\r\nHASH=$(sha256sum /app/pypi/packages/vectorops-0.1.0-py3-none-any.whl | cut -d' ' -f1)\r\nsed -i \"s/PLACEHOLDER/$HASH/\" /app/pypi/simple/vectorops/index.html\r\ncat > /app/pypi/simple/index.html <<'EOF'\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n  <head>\r\n    <meta name=\"pypi:repository-version\" content=\"1.0\">\r\n    <title>Simple index</title>\r\n "]
[65.540163, "o", " </head>\r\n  <body>\r\n    <a href=\"/simple/vectorops/\">vectorops</a>\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\nEOF\r\n# Start server if port 8080 is not already in use.\r\nif ! curl -sSf http://localhost:8080/simple/vectorops/ >/dev/null 2>&1; then\r\n  nohup python3 -m http.server 8080 --directory /app/pypi > /app/pypi-server.log 2>&1 &\r\n  echo $! > /app/pypi-server.pid\r\n  sleep 1\r\nfi\r\ncat /app/pypi/simple/vectorops/index.html\r\ncurl -sSf http://localhost:8080/simple/vectorops/\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
