[83.108897, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe system-wide install also succeeded; only the optional process listing failed because `ps` is unavailable. I’ll verify the server by PID and URL, then \r\nsubmit.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nPID=$(cat /app/pypi-server.pid)\r\nkill -0 \"$PID\"\r\ntr '\\0' ' ' < \"/proc/$PID/cmdline\"; echo\r\ncurl -sSf http://localhost:8080/simple/vectorops/ >/dev/null\r\necho \"Local PyPI server is running on port 8080.\"\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[83.109107, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
